  "visualTeachingNotes": [
    "A person walking away, leaving a trail of footprints behind.",
    "Oracle is a tall twisted sequence of linked curves, more like a traced path or repeated movement than a recognizable modern 後.",
    "Regular 後 standardizes 彳 on the left and the layered right side; Mainland simplified 后 replaces this historical structure with a much shorter modern form."
  ],
